        "statement": "Both chains have source alignments to the deposited P32178 reference over positions 1–256. At positions 218–221, the sequence-difference records declare GLU/ARG/ARG/ILE versus reference ASN/GLU/SER/GLY, labeled conflict. All four positions are unmodeled in both chains, so their coordinates cannot adjudicate the sequence discrepancy. These are not established engineered substitutions; wild-type identity and the cause remain unresolved.",
