        "assertion_id": "snapshot-conditions",
        "status": "deposited_source_assertion",
        "statement": "The retained X-ray deposit reports a refinement high-resolution limit of 3.0 angstrom and crystal-growth pH 8.0. TSA component definitions contain hydrogen atoms, while its selected coordinates contain only heavy atoms, with occupancy 1.00 and B factors 84.37–96.69 square angstrom. The reported overall mean B factor is 38.6 square angstrom. These model descriptors do not resolve bound protonation, validate hydrogen positions or provide calibrated coordinate-error estimates.",
