        "status": "deposited_source_assertion",
        "statement": "Assembly 1 is author-defined and uses identity operator 1 with A,B,C,D,E,F. Two other dimeric assembly declarations are software-defined PISA alternatives and remain separate. Source TRP binding-site rows AC1/AC2 also invoke crystallographic symmetry labels 12_555/4_555; this assembly-1 projection therefore does not claim complete regulatory-interface geometry or independent validation of a solution assembly.",
