        "statement": "The deposit software lists Lys168, Glu246 and Glu198 within the TSA binding sites. This project selects O7/O5 separations to those groups, retaining both named oxygens for each selected glutamate. The Euclidean distances describe the inhibitor model; they do not establish catalytic roles, hydrogen bonds, proton transfer, substrate/transition-state atom mapping or design tolerances. Chains A and B are separate coordinate copies, not independent experimental replicates.",
